<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>صفحه پیدا نشد</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap Icons (free) -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <!-- Vazir font for modern Persian typography -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/rastikerdar/vazir-font@v30.1.0/dist/font-face.css">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Vazir', 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #f7f9fc 0%, #eef2f7 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .notfound-container {
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .notfound-card {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 48px;
            padding: 55px 40px 45px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 20, 40, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;
            animation: fadeSlide 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
        }

            .notfound-card:hover {
                transform: translateY(-6px);
                box-shadow: 0 35px 65px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07), 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
            }

        /* ----- 404 ILLUSTRATION (large number + ghost icon) ----- */
        .error-illustration {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .big-404 {
            font-size: 130px;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
            color: #0b1e3a;
            letter-spacing: -4px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #4f8cff);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            text-shadow: none;
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: -10px;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

            .big-404:hover {
                transform: scale(1.02);
            }

        .ghost-icon {
            font-size: 58px;
            color: #4a6fa5;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.06);
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: -20px auto 0;
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.04);
        }

            .ghost-icon i {
                filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08));
                transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            }

            .ghost-icon:hover i {
                transform: rotate(8deg) scale(1.05);
            }

        /* ----- TYPOGRAPHY ----- */
        .notfound-card h1 {
            margin-top: 22px;
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0b1e3a;
            letter-spacing: -0.2px;
        }

        .notfound-card p {
            margin-top: 18px;
            color: #4a5a72;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 2;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

            .notfound-card p br {
                display: block;
                margin: 3px 0;
            }

        /* ----- BUTTON (glass + gradient) ----- */
        .btn-home {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 34px;
            padding: 16px 42px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #3b82f6);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -6px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
            border: none;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

            .btn-home i {
                font-size: 22px;
                transition: transform 0.25s ease;
            }

            .btn-home:hover {
                background: #1d4ed8;
                transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.01);
                box-shadow: 0 18px 35px -8px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.45);
                color: white;
                text-decoration: none;
            }

            .btn-home:active {
                transform: scale(0.96);
                box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.3);
            }

            .btn-home:hover i {
                transform: translateX(-5px);
            }

        /* ----- ERROR CODE (subtle badge) ----- */
        .error-code-badge {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #7b8aa3;
            font-weight: 400;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01);
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 7px 24px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
            letter-spacing: 0.4px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }

        /* ----- ANIMATION ----- */
        @@keyframes fadeSlide {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.96);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
            }
        }

        /* ----- RESPONSIVE (mobile-first) ----- */
        @@media (max-width: 640px) {
            .notfound-card {
                padding: 38px 22px 32px;
                border-radius: 36px;
                backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            }

            .big-404 {
                font-size: 90px;
                letter-spacing: -2px;
            }

            .ghost-icon {
                width: 80px;
                height: 80px;
                font-size: 44px;
                margin-top: -14px;
            }

            .notfound-card h1 {
                font-size: 27px;
                margin-top: 18px;
            }

            .notfound-card p {
                font-size: 16px;
                line-height: 1.9;
                padding: 0 2px;
            }

            .btn-home {
                padding: 13px 32px;
                font-size: 15px;
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 270px;
                gap: 8px;
            }

                .btn-home i {
                    font-size: 20px;
                }

            .error-code-badge {
                font-size: 13px;
                padding: 5px 18px;
                margin-top: 26px;
            }
        }

        @@media (max-width: 400px) {
            .notfound-card {
                padding: 30px 16px 26px;
                border-radius: 28px;
            }

            .big-404 {
                font-size: 70px;
            }

            .ghost-icon {
                width: 65px;
                height: 65px;
                font-size: 34px;
                margin-top: -10px;
            }

            .notfound-card h1 {
                font-size: 23px;
            }

            .notfound-card p {
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 1.8;
            }

            .btn-home {
                padding: 11px 22px;
                font-size: 14px;
                max-width: 210px;
            }

            .error-code-badge {
                font-size: 12px;
                padding: 4px 14px;
            }
        }

        /* subtle background decorations */
        .notfound-container::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: -30%;
            right: -15%;
            width: 350px;
            height: 350px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .notfound-container::after {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            bottom: -25%;
            left: -10%;
            width: 400px;
            height: 400px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 150, 100, 0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .notfound-card {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="notfound-container">
        <div class="notfound-card">
            <!-- Illustration: big 404 + ghost / search icon -->
            <div class="error-illustration">
                <div class="big-404">۴۰۴</div>
                <div class="ghost-icon">
                    <i class="bi bi-search"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h1>صفحه پیدا نشد</h1>

            <p>
                متأسفیم، صفحه‌ای که به دنبال آن هستید وجود ندارد.
                <br>
                ممکن است آدرس را اشتباه وارد کرده باشید یا صفحه حذف شده باشد.
            </p>

            <a href="/" class="btn-home">
                <i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i>
                بازگشت به خانه
            </a>

            <div class="error-code-badge">
                Error 404 — صفحه پیدا نشد
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>